Dear Linux users,

I have uploaded sources and a Linux binary for DDD 1.2, a graphical
front-end to GDB, on sunsite.unc.edu; it should appear in
`/pub/Linux/devel/debuggers' soon.  Other source and binary sites are
listed below.

The Linux DDD binary is self-contained; no special installation or
other files should be required.  Run DDD and select 'Help Index' to
browse the manual; `ddd --manual' generates a printable copy.

