C2PS 1.21 is uploaded to ftp.ifcss.org.


What's c2ps?

Translate Big5 coded Chinese documents into Level 2 PostScript
file. It uses Chinese TrueType fonts that are available at
  ftp.ifcss.org://pub/software/fonts/big5/ms-win
You can produce the most beautiful documents with C2PS.


What's new?
==========================                                          
1.20 -> 1.21 (Apr 20 '95)                                           
==========================                                          
 o Fix that sometimes the last page doesn't gen /showpage in ps     
 o Add -ww                                                          
 o Add -pk[r,g,b] and -pg to add colors or grayscale to paper       
 o Add @tl[0,1]@ to change the landscape mode in the document       
 o Add @tu@, @tf@, @tt@, @ts@ for changing the corresponding mode    
 o Make line wrapping the default mode. Now the -tr (and @tr@) means
   relaxed about the right margin. Sorry about the inconvenience.   
 o Add -tna and @tna[0,1]$ for not aligning English characters.     
 o Allow user to change the name of english fonts, e.g.             
       -fe3 Times,-Roman,-Bold,-Italic,-BoldItalic                  
   will make Times to be the English font no. 3.                    


